A basis-preserving commodity replacement carries SEK basis without a sale price.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight transactions --id 7 --format text

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity OLD
  format 1,000 OLD
commodity NEW
  format 1,000 NEW
account Assets:Shares
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Shares  2 OLD {100 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -200 SEK

2024-02-01 Basis-preserving replacement
  Assets:Shares  -2 OLD {{200 SEK}}
  Assets:Shares  5 NEW {{200 SEK}}

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-02-01 Basis-preserving replacement
    Assets:Shares                       -2 OLD {100.00 SEK}
    Assets:Shares                       5 NEW {40.00 SEK}

========== WARNINGS ==========
